GameTranslator

Based on CouchSubs by Sinan Yorulmaz
Copyright (C) 2026 Sinan Yorulmaz
https://github.com/yorulmazsinan/couchsubs

GameTranslator is a modified version of CouchSubs. It has been modified since
2026-11-10 (renamed, user interface redesign, reading and translation changes,
Android phone app). The list of changes is in this repository's git history.

Arabic edition (https://github.com/mraba7/gamegta): modified since 2026-11-18
(Arabic as the target language with right-to-left subtitles and a bundled
Arabic font on the TV, choice of AI translation service and quality mode,
Turkish-only features switched off for other target languages, updates from
this fork). The list of changes is in this repository's git history.

